{"id":"vd-b1-twenty-years-later","level":"b1","n":39,"title":{"en":"What Have You Been Up To?","vi":"Dạo này cậu thế nào?"},"summary":"Trên bậc thềm trường cũ, Grace và Liam cập nhật cho nhau hai mươi năm cuộc đời — trước khi dám nhắc đến chuyện năm xưa.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-twenty-years-later","level":"b1","title":{"en":"Twenty Years Later","vi":"Hai mươi năm sau"}},"scene":{"background":"campus-gate","props":[]},"cast":{"grace":{"name":{"en":"Grace","vi":"Grace"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#6B4226","outfit":"blouse","top":"#C0392B","topShade":"#A93226"}},"liam":{"name":{"en":"Liam","vi":"Liam"},"look":"man","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#3A2A22","glasses":true,"outfit":"shirt","top":"#2E86AB","topShade":"#246E8D"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"liam","en":"Hi, Grace. It's been ages.","vi":"Chào Grace. Lâu lắm rồi nhỉ.","ipa":["haɪ","ɡɹeɪs","ɪts","bɪn","ˈeɪdʒəz"],"start":0.554,"end":3.794,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.134],[2,2.673],[3,2.907],[4,3.18]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"Liam. Wow. Twenty years. I haven't seen you since graduation.","vi":"Liam. Chà. Hai mươi năm. Tớ chưa gặp lại cậu từ ngày tốt nghiệp.","ipa":["ˈliəm","waʊ","ˈtwɛnti","jɪɹz","aɪ","ˈhævənt","sin","ju","sɪns","ˌɡɹædʒuˈeɪʃən"],"start":4.584,"end":11.194,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,4.584],[1,5.93],[2,7.298],[3,7.688],[4,9.199],[5,9.342],[6,9.667],[7,9.902],[8,10.032],[9,10.292]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"You look exactly the same.","vi":"Cậu trông vẫn y như xưa.","ipa":["ju","lʊk","ɪɡˈzæktli","ðə","seɪm"],"start":11.984,"end":13.494,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,11.984],[1,12.12],[2,12.316],[3,12.915],[4,13.045]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"That's a lie, but thank you. So, what have you been up to?","vi":"Nói dối đấy, nhưng cảm ơn nhé. Vậy dạo này cậu thế nào?","ipa":["ðæts","ə","laɪ","bʌt","θæŋk","ju","soʊ","wʌt","hæv","ju","bɪn","ʌp","tu"],"start":14.284,"end":18.524,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,14.284],[1,14.486],[2,14.564],[3,15.189],[4,15.397],[5,15.644],[6,16.884],[7,17.443],[8,17.6],[9,17.73],[10,17.847],[11,18.029],[12,18.186]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"Oh, lots of things. I studied history, and now I teach at a school near the coast.","vi":"Ồ, nhiều chuyện lắm. Tớ học sử, và giờ tớ dạy ở một trường gần biển.","ipa":["oʊ","lɑts","ʌv","θɪŋz","aɪ","ˈstʌdid","ˈhɪstɚi","ənd","naʊ","aɪ","titʃ","æt","ə","skul","nɪɹ","ðə","koʊst"],"start":19.314,"end":25.244,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,19.314],[1,19.76],[2,20.059],[3,20.151],[4,21.611],[5,21.806],[6,22.223],[7,22.965],[8,23.134],[9,23.382],[10,23.499],[11,23.864],[12,23.955],[13,24.02],[14,24.437],[15,24.606],[16,24.71]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"A teacher! Like Mr. Ellis?","vi":"Giáo viên à! Giống thầy Ellis sao?","ipa":["ə","ˈtitʃɚ","laɪk","ˈmɪstɚ","ˈɛlɪs"],"start":26.034,"end":28.714,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,26.034],[1,26.086],[2,27.586],[3,27.872],[4,28.263]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"I hope I'm less boring. What about you? What do you do now?","vi":"Mong là tớ đỡ nhàm chán hơn thầy. Còn cậu? Giờ cậu làm gì?","ipa":["aɪ","hoʊp","aɪm","lɛs","ˈbɔɹɪŋ","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ju","wʌt","du","ju","du","naʊ"],"start":29.504,"end":34.264,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,29.504],[1,29.572],[2,29.846],[3,30.002],[4,30.262],[5,31.697],[6,31.892],[7,32.166],[8,33.364],[9,33.559],[10,33.637],[11,33.754],[12,33.936]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"I'm an architect. I design schools and libraries, mostly.","vi":"Tớ là kiến trúc sư. Chủ yếu tớ thiết kế trường học và thư viện.","ipa":["aɪm","æn","ˈɑɹkəˌtɛkt","aɪ","dɪˈzaɪn","skulz","ənd","ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹiz","ˈmoʊstli"],"start":35.054,"end":39.464,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,35.054],[1,35.161],[2,35.292],[3,36.973],[4,37.117],[5,37.546],[6,37.924],[7,38.054],[8,38.861]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"That's perfect. You were always drawing buildings in maths lessons.","vi":"Thế thì hợp quá. Hồi đó giờ toán cậu lúc nào cũng vẽ nhà cửa.","ipa":["ðæts","pɚˈfɛkt","ju","wɝ","ˈɔlˌweɪz","ˈdɹɔɪŋ","ˈbɪldɪŋz","ɪn","mæθs","ˈlɛsənz"],"start":40.254,"end":44.884,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,40.254],[1,40.492],[2,42.056],[3,42.252],[4,42.434],[5,42.798],[6,43.202],[7,43.671],[8,43.814],[9,44.218]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"Ha! You remember that? Are you still living in town?","vi":"Ha! Cậu còn nhớ à? Cậu vẫn sống ở thị trấn chứ?","ipa":["hɑ","ju","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","ðæt","ɑɹ","ju","stɪl","ˈlɪvɪŋ","ɪn","taʊn"],"start":45.674,"end":50.114,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,45.674],[1,46.805],[2,46.987],[3,47.391],[4,48.719],[5,48.888],[6,49.006],[7,49.266],[8,49.566],[9,49.683]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"No, I moved away years ago. Are you married?","vi":"Không, tớ chuyển đi lâu rồi. Cậu đã kết hôn chưa?","ipa":["noʊ","aɪ","muvd","əˈweɪ","jɪɹz","əˈɡoʊ","ɑɹ","ju","ˈmɛɹid"],"start":50.904,"end":54.674,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,50.904],[1,51.526],[2,51.656],[3,51.969],[4,52.255],[5,52.594],[6,53.911],[7,54.08],[8,54.198]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"Yes, with two kids. They're seven and ten. And you?","vi":"Rồi, có hai đứa nhỏ. Chúng bảy và mười tuổi. Còn cậu?","ipa":["jɛs","wɪð","tu","kɪdz","ðɛɹ","ˈsɛvən","ənd","tɛn","ənd","ju"],"start":55.464,"end":60.754,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,55.464],[1,56.04],[2,56.209],[3,56.418],[4,57.917],[5,58.152],[6,58.568],[7,58.712],[8,60.131],[9,60.365]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"A daughter. She's eleven, and she's much cleverer than me.","vi":"Một cô con gái. Con bé mười một tuổi, và thông minh hơn tớ nhiều.","ipa":["ə","ˈdɔtɚ","ʃiz","ɪˈlɛvən","ənd","ʃiz","mʌtʃ","ˈklɛvəˌɹɝ","ðæn","mi"],"start":61.544,"end":65.684,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,61.544],[1,61.625],[2,63.073],[3,63.398],[4,64.075],[5,64.219],[6,64.518],[7,64.792],[8,65.234],[9,65.404]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"The town has changed so much. The old café has gone.","vi":"Thị trấn thay đổi nhiều quá. Quán cà phê cũ không còn nữa.","ipa":["ðə","taʊn","hæz","tʃeɪndʒd","soʊ","mʌtʃ","ðə","oʊld","kəˈfeɪ","hæz","ɡɔn"],"start":66.474,"end":70.564,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,66.474],[1,66.532],[2,66.845],[3,67.014],[4,67.418],[5,67.678],[6,69.126],[7,69.295],[8,69.542],[9,69.894],[10,70.115]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"I know. Last time I saw you, we were sitting in that café.","vi":"Tớ biết. Lần cuối tớ gặp cậu, tụi mình đang ngồi ở quán đó.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","læst","taɪm","aɪ","sɔ","ju","wi","wɝ","ˈsɪtɪŋ","ɪn","ðæt","kəˈfeɪ"],"start":71.354,"end":75.734,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,71.354],[1,71.422],[2,72.792],[3,73.156],[4,73.378],[5,73.495],[6,73.794],[7,74.302],[8,74.432],[9,74.575],[10,74.94],[11,75.018],[12,75.2]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"I remember. It was just before the scholarship… and everything.","vi":"Tớ nhớ. Ngay trước vụ học bổng… và mọi chuyện.","ipa":["aɪ","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","ɪt","wɑz","dʒʌst","bɪˈfɔɹ","ðə","ˈskɑlɚˌʃɪp","ənd","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ"],"start":76.524,"end":80.944,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,76.524],[1,76.605],[2,78.157],[3,78.313],[4,78.495],[5,78.769],[6,79.081],[7,79.199],[8,80.188],[9,80.318]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"I was jealous back then, I admit. But I never understood why you stopped talking to me.","vi":"Hồi đó tớ ghen tị, tớ thừa nhận. Nhưng tớ chưa bao giờ hiểu vì sao cậu không nói chuyện với tớ nữa.","ipa":["aɪ","wɑz","ˈdʒɛləs","bæk","ðɛn","aɪ","ədˈmɪt","bʌt","aɪ","ˈnɛvɚ","ˌʌndɚˈstʊd","waɪ","ju","stɑpt","ˈtɔkɪŋ","tu","mi"],"start":81.734,"end":87.484,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,81.734],[1,81.815],[2,82.037],[3,82.453],[4,82.766],[5,83.274],[6,83.417],[7,84.786],[8,84.942],[9,85.008],[10,85.398],[11,85.971],[12,86.153],[13,86.323],[14,86.713],[15,87.117],[16,87.234]]},{"speaker":"grace","en":"I heard some rumors. Maybe I should have asked you first.","vi":"Tớ đã nghe vài lời đồn. Có lẽ lẽ ra tớ nên hỏi cậu trước.","ipa":["aɪ","hɝd","sʌm","ˈɹumɚz","ˈmeɪbi","aɪ","ʃʊd","hæv","æskt","ju","fɝst"],"start":88.274,"end":92.084,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,88.274],[1,88.345],[2,88.606],[3,88.814],[4,90.288],[5,90.665],[6,90.756],[7,90.952],[8,91.095],[9,91.407],[10,91.525]]},{"speaker":"liam","en":"Then let's talk now. We've waited twenty years.","vi":"Vậy thì nói ngay bây giờ đi. Tụi mình đã đợi hai mươi năm rồi.","ipa":["ðɛn","lɛts","tɔk","naʊ","wiv","ˈweɪtɪd","ˈtwɛnti","jɪɹz"],"start":92.874,"end":96.594,"gesture":"nod","react":{"grace":"shy"},"timing":[[0,92.874],[1,93.109],[2,93.382],[3,93.695],[4,95.012],[5,95.298],[6,95.702],[7,96.066]]}],"words":[{"id":"architect","en":"architect","ipa":"ˈɑɹkəˌtɛkt","vi":"kiến trúc sư; người kiến tạo","level":2},{"id":"married","en":"married","ipa":"ˈmɛɹid","vi":"đã kết hôn; đã cưới; có gia đình","level":1},{"id":"boring","en":"boring","ipa":"ˈbɔɹɪŋ","vi":"nhàm chán; chán ngắt","level":0},{"id":"remember","en":"remember","ipa":"ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","vi":"nhớ; ghi nhớ; nhớ lại","level":0},{"id":"since","en":"since","ipa":"sɪns","vi":"kể từ; từ khi; vì","level":1},{"id":"clever","en":"clever","ipa":"ˈklɛvɚ","vi":"thông minh; khéo léo","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi han bạn cũ sau nhiều năm","pattern":"It's been ages! · What have you been up to? · I haven't seen you since… · Are you still…? · So what do you do now? · Last time I saw you,…","explain":"Gặp lại người quen lâu ngày: \"It's been ages!\", \"Long time no see!\". Hỏi về quãng thời gian đã qua bằng hiện tại hoàn thành: \"What have you been up to?\", \"I haven't seen you since graduation.\" Hỏi thay đổi: \"Are you still living in…?\"","keys":["it's been ages","what have you been up to","i haven't seen you since","are you still","what do you do now","last time i saw you"],"lines":[0,1,3,6,9,14]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-twenty-years-later.mp3","v":"d789699d24","duration":97.68,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}